    "numeric_rules": "seq is uint32; scheduled_send_ms is finite nonnegative decimal <= 9007199254740991 with at most 3 effective fractional decimal digits and is never rounded by the encoder; stored timestamp token must equal shortest canonical numeric serialization except exact numeric-zero spellings; decimal exponent magnitude above 10000 is rejected; stored seq, temperature, humidity, pressure use canonical integer JSON tokens only; negative zero normalizes to zero; temperature 15..45, humidity 30..80, pressure 950..1150; preserve supplied values",
